# Memory Bank Rule

## Context

The Memory Bank lives in `docs/memory/`. The index is `docs/memory-bank.md` (read order and file guide).

## Rule

- Before broad, ambiguous, or architecture-affecting work, read the relevant files in `docs/memory/` per `docs/memory-bank.md`.
- When durable project facts or status change, update the affected Memory Bank files in the same task by reading and following `.cursor/skills/memory-bank-update/SKILL.md`.

## How to verify

1. Confirm edits follow the skill’s steps, outputs, and safety section.
2. Confirm only `docs/memory/*.md` files whose facts changed were edited and still match `docs/memory-bank.md`.
